# Credentials and signing material (F20, ADR-0018).
# This section is not hypothetical hygiene: every commit in this repo is made with `git add -A`,
# so a keystore or a google-services.json dropped in the tree would be committed on the next one.
# The audit found ZERO coverage here and a clean history — this keeps the second half true.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
keystore.properties
secrets.properties
*.mobileprovision
service-account*.json
